    "text": "Be h\u00e6\u00f0endome.\nNemo cristianorum paganas superstitiones intendat, sed gentilium inquinamenta omnia omnino\nEala, mycel is nyd\u00feearf manna gehwylcum, \u00fe\u00e6t he wi\u00f0 deofles larswice warnige symle, and \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAnd, gyf hit geweor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t cristen man \u00e6fre heonanfor\u00f0 ahwar he\u00f0endom begange o\u00f0\u00f0on ahwar on\nAnd, gyf wiccean o\u00f0\u00f0e wigelearas, horingas o\u00f0\u00f0e horcwenan, mor\u00f0wyrhtan o\u00f0\u00f0e mansworan innan\nAnd do man, swa hit \u00feearf is, manfulra d\u00e6da on \u00e6ghwylcan ende styre man swy\u00f0e.\nHer syndan on earde godcundness\u00e6 wi\u00f0ersacan and godes lage oferhogan, manslagan and m\u00e6gslagan,\nAnd ne byrh\u00f0 se gesibba hwilan gesibban \u00fee ma, \u00fee \u00f0am fremdan, ne bro\u00f0or his bre\u00f0er o\u00fere hwile ne\nNe na fela manna ne healt his getryw\u00f0a swa wel, swa he scolde, for gode and for worolde.\nAc do man, swa hit \u00feearf is, gebete hit georne and cl\u00e6nsige \u00feas \u00feeode, gyf man godes miltse geearnian",
